== 改成 order.get("vip") is True
DIFF apply_discount {'vip': 1, 'items': [{'price': 100, 'qty': 1}]} ('ok', 90.0) -> ('ok', 100)
DIFF is_vip {'vip': 1, 'items': [{'price': 100, 'qty': 1}]} ('ok', True) -> ('ok', False)
DIFF apply_discount+coupons {'vip': 1, 'items': [{'price': 100, 'qty': 1}]} ('ok', 80.0) -> ('ok', 90)
DIFF summarize ('ok', (2446.0, 271.77777777777777, 2)) -> ('ok', (2456.0, 272.8888888888889, 2))
比對 11 筆輸入 × 3 種呼叫 + 4 批 summarize，差異 4 處
exit=1

== 同樣兩種改法跑現有單元測試
